 {"sec": "Hereditary spherocytosis — pathogenesis · p241", "page": 241, "q": "The primary abnormality that converts a normal discoid RBC into a spherical RBC in hereditary spherocytosis is —", "opts": ["Antibody coating of the red cell", "A globin chain substitution", "An RBC cytoskeletal protein defect", "Loss of the HMP shunt"], "ans": 2, "exp": "Normal discoid RBC + RBC cytoskeletal protein defect → spherical RBC. (Book p241)", "type": "mcq", "id": "PEDS-C51-010"},
