 {"sec": "Hereditary spherocytosis — management and splenectomy · p242–243", "page": 243, "q": "Among the precautions before splenectomy, surgery should be deferred until the child is older than ___ years of age.", "opts": ["10", "2", "4", "6"], "ans": 3, "exp": "Precautions: surgery > 6 years of age. (Book p243)", "type": "fill", "id": "PEDS-C51-075"},
