 {"sec": "G6PD deficiency — epidemiology and pathophysiology · p243", "page": 243, "q": "The final protective molecule generated by the intact HMP shunt is —", "opts": ["Oxidised glutathione", "Reduced glutathione", "Methaemoglobin", "Catalase"], "ans": 1, "exp": "Glutathione → reduced glutathione, which protects RBCs from oxidative stress. (Book p243)", "type": "mcq", "id": "PEDS-C51-089"},
