 {"sec": "Sickle cell anaemia — management and preventive care · p245", "page": 245, "q": "Exchange transfusion works by —", "opts": ["Sequential removal of HbS from circulation", "Increasing endogenous HbF synthesis", "Chelating the excess circulating iron", "Suppressing bone marrow erythropoiesis"], "ans": 0, "exp": "Exchange transfusion: sequential removal of HbS from circulation. (Book p245)", "type": "mcq", "id": "PEDS-C51-184"},
